TEXT 64 1192 Left 2 ;6-Bit Segmented DAC Core\n7 thermometer units (M51-M57) for 3 MSBs (8x unit weight each)\n4 binary units: M58a (1x), M59 (2x), M61 (4x), and one more for 8x\nCurrent steering switches with differential pairs\nTotal 64 codes: 000000 to 111111\nLSB = 12.5mV with R=1250 ohms and unit current
